# Project Structure Guidelines

The project should follow this structure:

```
fitness-rag/
├── config/
│   ├── model_config.yaml      # Model and training configurations
│   └── inference_config.yaml  # Inference configurations
├── src/
│   ├── models/               # Model architectures
│   ├── data/                 # Data loading and processing
│   ├── training/             # Training loops and utilities
│   ├── inference/            # Inference pipelines
│   └── utils/                # Helper functions
├── notebooks/                # Jupyter notebooks for experiments
├── scripts/                  # Training and inference scripts
├── tests/                    # Unit tests
└── gradio_app/              # Gradio interface
```

Each Python module should have a clear single responsibility and follow object-oriented or functional programming paradigms as appropriate.

